EffectCraft is an open source motion graphics and visual effects
compositor, a clean-room reimplementation of the Adobe After Effects
workflow written in pure Rust by the ArtCraft team.  It has compositions
with layers, keyframes and a graph editor, masks and shapes, text
animators, expressions, layer styles, 3D cameras and lights, over 300
effects and a render queue (H.264, HEVC, AV1, ProRes, WebM and image
sequences), composited on the GPU through wgpu.

The effectcraft-cli tool renders and runs the same engine commands from
scripts, and serves them over MCP for agents.
